items.description:
Get array of attribute values out of the parent config class. Attributes need to be in this format: "_n", where n is an index number (starting from 0). If any discrepancy in indexing is detected, loading will stop and only the correctly indexed values will be returned. Max. index supported is 99. If more then 9 attributes used, 0-9 need to use leading zeroes.

CFG example:

class Timeline {
    class StageA
    {
        _0[] = {2035,7,7,04,30};
        _1[] = {2035,7,7,06,15};
        _2[] = {2035,7,7,18,35};
        _3[] = {2035,7,8,09,05};
        _4[] = {2035,7,8,13,25};
        _5[] = {2035,7,8,17,10};
        _6[] = {2035,7,8,21,40};
        _7[] = {2035,7,9,19,55};
    };
};

